e>Conrad</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Dendritic-cell-based therapeutic vaccination against cancer</article-title><source>Current Opinion in Immunology</source><year>2005</year><volume>17</volume><fpage>163</fpage><lpage>169</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15766676</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.coi.2005.02.003</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Aloysius MM</surname><given-names>RRA</given-names><suffix>Eremin JM, Eremin O.</suffix></name></person-group><article-title>Vaccination therapy in malignant disease</article-title><source>Surgeon Journal of the Royal Colleges of Surgeons of Edinburgh &#x00026; Ireland</source><year>2006</year><volume>4</volume><fpage>309</fpage><lpage>320</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Caux</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Dezutter-Dambuyant</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Schmitt</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Banchereau</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>GM-CSF and TNF-alpha cooperate in the generation of dendritic Langerhans cells</article-title><source>Nature</source><year>1992</year><volume>360</volume><fpage>258</fpage><lpage>261</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1279441</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/360258a0</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Jansen</surname><given-names>JH</given-names></name><name><surname>Wientjens</surname><given-names>GJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Fibbe</surname><given-names>WE</given-names></name><name><surname>Willemze</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Kluin-Nelemans</surname><given-names>HC</given-names></name